<title>INDONESIA: Polyta 1996 net falls to 26.00 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Polyta 1996 net falls to 26.00 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 1996</p>
<p>		     (in billion rupiah unless earnings per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			  26.00 vs  58.52</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)    101  vs  227</p>
<p>    Net sales			  720.41 vs 587.22</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     126.51 vs 136.53</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  72.58 vs  95.11</p>
<p>    Profit before income tax	33.57 vs  73.25</p>
<p>and minority interest</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		661.45 vs 658.85</p>
<p>Note : The results were audited. PT Tri Polyta Indonesia is a petrochemical firm.</p>
</text>
